An abandoned piece of futuristic technology shaped like a great tree limb — a metal and machine sculpture — that NATURE HAS RECLAIMED. Moss, ivy, ferns and hanging moss have grown all over it over decades. It should feel like a real overgrown ruin you could photograph: mostly nature, with the metal and tech showing through where the growth is thinner.

