Branch like a real old tree, not a diagram: irregular fork positions, uneven angles, limbs of very different lengths and thicknesses, some limbs twisting, crossing behind others, one or two sagging, one broken stub, some short, some reaching far. Asymmetric overall silhouette, denser in some places and open in others. Nothing evenly spaced, nothing mirrored, no repeated angles.

