+Long Spanish moss and vines fall VERTICALLY downward at varied lengths, longest reaching y=1400–1580 on the right half. All foliage below y=700 must stay RIGHT of x=1270. No ground, trunk base, soil, other objects, floating isolated foliage, or roots reaching ground.
