+
+PRESERVE base sky gradient/clouds and all original navigation. ABSOLUTELY CLEAR: whole y<230 band, logo, Research / FAQs / Contact, meeting pill including the actual top-right position. Rectangle x=0–1250,y=700–1800 remains untouched pure sky. Entire left half mostly empty. No new text, labels, numbers, logos, watermarks, HUD, or UI. Render only one image, not a grid. Requested final size 2880 x 1800.
